      "value": "@{5980059a0f0b831904883973|full_name}: That is already in place.  I need to redo my avatar, because my giant fox has keyblades that stick straight out, because there's no dynamic bones for them.  I need to adjust the default to be down by default because of it.  and because I am technically out of range, and yet clearly in view, they see them stick straight out.  It also causes problems for chest physics.  if there's any gravity put on them,  they will cause some odd effects when they go in and out of range.\n\nI would rather have the option turned on and off on a per-player basis, instead of automatically turning on and off, or at least have the option of 3 choices:  On, Auto, Off",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
