      "value": "@{5a40000d4a8da674278040ba|full_name}: The issue here is that Dynamic Bone is a massive hit to CPU performance. For example, back before Dynamic Bone was widely used I could run two VRC windows under two VR headsets with 90 FPS on both, on the same PC. Now I have trouble running just one, and that’s on a significantly better specced PC than before. While it certainly makes avatars look great, it also murders the functionality of the app for a number of people, even users with higher end PCs.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
